# Paste-ready NON-SECRET Preview variables for Vercel (project jnr > Settings > Environment Variables > Add > paste into the Key field).
# Tick ONLY "Preview". These hold no secrets, so anyone (including Claude in Chrome) may paste them.
# The secret ones are NOT here: Rhys adds those himself, as Sensitive: S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID, S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, BUFFER_API_TOKEN.
# Fill the two blanks from Cloudflare first (account id in S3_ENDPOINT, the pub-....r2.dev address in PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE_URL).
S3_ENDPOINT=https://<ACCOUNT_ID>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
S3_REGION=auto
S3_BUCKET_PRIVATE=jnr-staging-private
S3_BUCKET_PUBLIC=jnr-staging-public
PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE_URL=https://<pub-xxxxxxxx>.r2.dev
BUFFER_ENV=staging
BUFFER_STAGING_CHANNEL_ID=6afa05fbece6dfde5fd74165
SITE_URL=https://jnr-git-feature-workshop-content-rhsys-projects.vercel.app
# Do NOT add DEPLOY_ENV, AI_CAPTIONS_ENABLED or TOLRA_ENABLED. DATABASE_URL is already there from the Neon integration.
